id: standard-clothing
name: Standard Clothing
kind: crafting
# "Reduces the Craft DC by 1 Difficulty Category."
craftDCShift: -1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  No Apparel Penalty, and a Craft DC one Difficulty lower.
text: >
  Standard Clothing. Standard Clothing does not inflict Apparel Penalties and reduces the Craft
  DC by 1 Difficulty Category.

---

# "Standard Clothing does not inflict Apparel Penalties" - while it is the Top Layer, by the
# table's ruling, as every Category's benefit is. "And reduces the Craft DC by 1 Difficulty
# Category" is how it is made rather than what it does: `craftDCShift` in the header.
[passive]
piece.countsForPenalty = false;
